1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.imperiali.com/?lang=it&center=gruppo&action=riccardo-imperiali
2 CONT
2 CONT Riccardo Imperiali
2 CONT
2 CONT He is a civil lawyer, registered with the Naples Bar Association, with legal aid before the Supreme Court of Cassation. He was born in Naples in June 1957, where he lives with his family and works in Milan, Naples and Rome. Expert
2 CONC  in business organization, he collaborates with industrial and trade associations and with companies and public bodies, to promote the understanding and application of regulations with a high impact on business processes.
2 CONT
2 CONT UPDATE
2 CONT
2 CONT He has published several volumes on data protection and company organization for the Il Sole 24 Ore and Giuffrè types.
2 CONT
2 CONT THE COMUNICATION
2 CONT
2 CONT As a journalist, he acts as a commentator on Il Sole 24 Ore, and in other newspapers and magazines of law and business organization.
2 CONT
2 CONT PERIODIC COLUMNS
2 CONT
2 CONT "L'Esperto answers" in the newspaper Il Sole 24 Ore, on the issues of protection and security of information and of corporate criminal liability. "The enterprise in the Information Age" in the daily Il Money.
2 CONT
2 CONT THE DOCTORS
2 CONT
2 CONT He frequently teaches - in the classroom and at a distance - courses and masters at Italian universities, the Council of the Bar Association, the Ministries of the Interior and Justice and Confindustria.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.famiglienobilinapolitane.it/Genealogie/Imperiali.htm
